From a06b348d7b1c5dab00c4c628387154fddb1887c6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 16:32:39 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 5/5] efr32bg22: watchdog fast path in the bridge, PC in
 requests, timer event fix, PC histogram

The stock main loop spins in WDOG_Feed; caching EN/SYNCBUSY reads and rate-limiting CMD
writes in QEMU makes the simulation run ~10x further per wall second. Requests now carry
the guest PC (used for trace lines and a PC histogram on exit).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01PdMVRPYdkoKYyoN2UWrcnz
---
 hw/arm/efr32bg22.c        | 56 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 tools/efr32bg22/models.py | 62 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-----
 tools/efr32bg22/server.py | 20 +++++++++----
 3 files changed, 124 insertions(+), 14 deletions(-)

diff --git a/hw/arm/efr32bg22.c b/hw/arm/efr32bg22.c
index 3f1a6d0..92fcbea 100644
--- a/hw/arm/efr32bg22.c
+++ b/hw/arm/efr32bg22.c
@@ -40,6 +40,7 @@
 #include "sysemu/sysemu.h"
